{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a6389aa9dc5a833d9776","chatId":"d279e8663a7844c7b1c8a281af497d64","sessionId":null,"userId":99139,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"F\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"F\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1271,"promptTokens":543,"completionTokens":125,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:42:48"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005217995207098499,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a6389aa9dc5a833d9775","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483768949,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:42:48","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a6389aa9dc5a833d9775","chatId":"d279e8663a7844c7b1c8a281af497d64","sessionId":null,"userId":99139,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n自高中时起，莉丝和小蒙一直是最好的朋友。最近，莉丝对小蒙产生了感情，并决定告白。她反复排练后，在内心怦然而动的情况下，坦白了自己的感情。小蒙告诉她，他已经和另外一个人交往了几个月。莉丝祝贺了他，然后匆匆离开。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小蒙最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 惊讶 & 自豪\nB) 惊讶 & 愧疚\nC) 反对 & 生气\nD) 愧疚 & 自豪\nE) 反对 & 自豪\nF) 愧疚 & 反对\n\n## 问题 2\n小蒙为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 他不得不拒绝朋友的告白, 因为他已经有了一个恋爱关系 & 他希望他能是第一个表白的人\nB) 艾丽斯与他的女朋友是好朋友 & 他希望他能是第一个表白的人\nC) 他以为艾莉丝即将宣布她的订婚 & 艾丽斯与他的女朋友是好朋友\nD) 艾丽斯记得他的生日 & 他希望他没有告诉艾丽斯他的另一段恋情\nE) 他不得不拒绝朋友的告白, 因为他已经有了一个恋爱关系 & 他希望他没有告诉艾丽斯他的另一段恋情\nF) 他发现他的朋友对他产生了感情 & 他不得不拒绝朋友的告白, 因为他已经有了一个恋爱关系","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005217995207098499,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a6389aa9dc5a833d9776","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483768946,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:42:48","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"88ac069d11bd454caee9a9485848444c"}